VALUES (25392, 'tt0042393', NULL, 'Destination Moon', 'Destination Moon', 'movie', 1950, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dsJUooqTX5BkOmkfnuuFlkmbB6.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3RKBbSG68HdAeXmVa3h9G7nBMbh.jpg', 'A team composed of an aerospace scientist, an ex-Air Force general, and an industrialist conceives an ambitious plan to land Americans on the moon. From their base in the Mojave Desert, they construct and successfully launch a spacecraft named "Luna" that contains a cargo of four astronauts. But a critical miscalculation of needed power to escape the moon''s gravitational pull may put the astronauts'' lives in danger.', NULL, NULL, 1.3548, 5.914, 0, 1.01, '2026-11-25 14:37:42', '2026-11-25 14:37:42')
