VALUES (50977, 'tt0056293', NULL, 'Nude on the Moon', 'Nude on the Moon', 'movie', 1961, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wBTbmSSRCh6qxpNesRYximBS4gz.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tfU2yq4rUkpElRMRfCWg7r288nA.jpg', 'Through an unexpected inheritance, a couple of male scientists travel to the moon via a rocket of their own design. There, they find a lush garden paradise rather than a barren wasteland. They''re captured by (semi-nude) telepathic humanoids and taken before the Great Council, where the Moon Goddess decides they should be allowed to continue their experiments. One falls in love, the other seeks to return home.', NULL, NULL, 1.1432, 4.2, 0, 1.01, '2026-11-25 14:37:42', '2026-11-25 14:37:42')
