VALUES (530578, 'tt0419821', NULL, 'The Legend of the Stardust Brothers', '星くず兄弟の伝説', 'movie', 1985, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkT12vml7dNS53OmjNnuzqX9jYm.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gY3gWaK6NGUvEKoWFYaSSj9IUVS.jpg', 'A shady music mogul brings together two wannabe stars—punk rock rebel Kan and new-wave crooner Shingo—and transforms them into the Stardust Brothers, a girl-friendly, silver-jumpsuited, synth-pop sensation. Along with their #1 fan, who herself dreams of a music career, the duo rockets to stardom.', NULL, NULL, 1.0597, 6.929, 0, 1.12, '2026-11-25 14:37:42', '2026-11-25 14:37:42')
