VALUES (13477, 'tt1185416', NULL, 'When in Rome', 'When in Rome', 'movie', 2010, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pteIGpJpgh2aUh3jMqZnomB1rw1.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/raQIYTSZ7vtHgqzZBX4oDj9Tp1C.jpg', 'Disillusioned with romance, Beth, an ambitious New Yorker, travels to Rome for her sister''s wedding, where she plucks magic coins from a special fountain of love. The coins attract unwanted attention from an assortment of odd yet ardent suitors:  a sausage merchant, a street magician, an artist, and a male model. But when the best man from the wedding, persistent reporter Nick, throws his hat in the ring, Beth wonders if his love is the real thing.', NULL, NULL, 2.8617, 5.914, 0, 10.01, '2026-11-25 14:37:42', '2026-11-25 14:37:42')
