VALUES (339964, 'tt2239822', NULL, 'Valerian and the City of a Thousand Planets', 'Valerian and the City of a Thousand Planets', 'movie', 2017, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlc95gl3PtrjxSEuM8RhTtSm2xU.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5rYnygKCkmqWuMv1O5yAnzGF8gV.jpg', 'In the 28th century, Valerian and Laureline are special operatives charged with keeping order throughout the human territories. On assignment from the Minister of Defense, the two undertake a mission to Alpha, an ever-expanding metropolis where species from across the universe have converged over centuries to share knowledge, intelligence, and cultures. At the center of Alpha is a mysterious dark force which threatens the peaceful existence of the City of a Thousand Planets, and Valerian and Laureline must race to identify the menace and safeguard not just Alpha, but the future of the universe.', NULL, NULL, 10.5405, 6.655, 0, 2.43370000000000032e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-11-25 14:37:42')
